# Refactor Trigger

When Java file looks like legacy JavaFX living inside JRebirth application — class mixes state scene graph nodes event handlers business logic — do not edit piecemeal Restructure step step using JRebirth role split

## Signs file needs refactoring

- A single class holds fields both UI nodes application state
- Event handlers contain business logic instead delegating Model or Command
- `Platform.runLater` or raw threads appear middle feature code
- The class directly reads or writes database REST endpoint or file

## Refactor steps

1. Identify part JRebirth role split missing or misplaced
2. Move application state bindings Model
3. Move scene graph node construction View
4. Move event wiring gesture translation Controller
5. Extract explicit actions Commands
6. Extract slow external or backend work Services
7. Introduce Waves only where cross-feature communication genuinely decoupled

## Safety rule

Refactor incrementally Split work small reviewable steps so each change can understood verified independently Do not rewrite everything one pass

Use `refactor-legacy` skill before editing many files once
